{"id":"wb-6-600","name":"建瓯东岳庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"建瓯东岳庙","text":"建瓯东岳庙，是位于中国福建省建瓯市建安街道东门外的一所东岳庙，1982年被列为建瓯县文物保护单位，1996年被列为福建省文物保护单位，2006年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。\n建瓯东岳庙重建于清康熙十一年（1672年），多次重修。庙坐北朝南，前临建溪，后依白鹤山，占地面积26640平方米。有山门、前殿、戏台、圣帝殿、娘娘殿、慈航殿、药师殿等建筑。圣帝殿面阔五间，进深四间，重檐歇山顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BB%BA%E7%93%AF%E4%B8%9C%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86565063,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86565063","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a3f2150de0463f19ed637ef7.jpg","title":"Jian'ou_Dongyue_Miao_2012.08.25_10-59-58.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jian%27ou_Dongyue_Miao_2012.08.25_10-59-58.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Jian%27ou_Dongyue_Miao_2012.08.25_10-59-58.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​建瓯东岳庙，位于中国福建省建瓯市。","width":320,"height":213}}